CHANCERY PHASE 8 — correction-learning loop (RAG over the correction log)
=========================================================================
Status: VERIFIED GREEN — 11/11 pass, 0 fail, 0 skip. HELD for manual review.

MECHANISM (not fine-tuning): a correction LOG (document_field_corrections) read
back at inference time. Relevant past corrections steer the NEXT matching
document — no batch retraining, no delay.

TASK 1 — DISCOVERY (findings, verified against live DB + real code)
  (a) document_field_corrections: (id, document_id, org_id, template_extraction_id
      [nullable], field_name, original_value, corrected_value, notes, corrected_by,
      corrected_at). NO schema change needed.
        - Extraction/K-1 corrections: join template_extraction_id ->
          document_template_extractions.template_type ('k1'). Sufficient.
        - Classification corrections had NO capture path (documents has no
          `category` column, only doc_family; the only writer wrote template-field
          corrections). Encoded WITHOUT a schema change via reserved
          field_name='doc_category' + NULL template_extraction_id.
        - The table was EMPTY at sprint start (Phase 6/7 verifies tore down their
          rows) — the loop is proven on freshly seeded data.
  (b) classify_document builds _build_system_prompt(candidates) then calls
      call_claude_json — few-shot block appended to the system prompt before that
      call, gated by use_corrections.
  (c) K-1 mapping (map_k1_fields) is DETERMINISTIC regex, NOT an AI call. So
      corrections are applied as a deterministic post-map layer
      (apply_field_corrections) in run_k1_extraction, gated by use_corrections —
      not few-shot injection.

TASK 2 — services/correction_retrieval.py
  get_relevant_corrections(conn, org_id, context) — classification | extraction,
  org_id-filtered IN THE SQL (data isolation independent of RLS), capped at 5.
  format_classification_examples() (few-shot text) + apply_field_corrections()
  (deterministic K-1 override). Empty history -> no-op everywhere.

TASK 3 — wiring
  - classify_document: retrieves + injects classification few-shot (use_corrections).
  - run_k1_extraction / extract_k1_and_link: applies field corrections post-map
    (use_corrections). Zero corrections never alters/breaks either path.
  - Added submit_classification_correction (service + POST
    /documents/{id}/classification-correction) to CLOSE the loop (doc_category
    corrections were previously unrecorded).

TASK 4 — scripts/eval_correction_loop.py (DeepEval, no-judge DocumentTypeSortAccuracy)
  Realistic dual-purpose cases; before/after, rolled back. MEASURED (Haiku):
    WITHOUT retrieval: 1/3 = 33.3%
    WITH    retrieval: 3/3 = 100.0%
    delta = +66.7 pts (2 cases flipped wrong->right; 1 already correct). Honest.

